    "q_1_remedy": {
      "id": "q_1_remedy",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "A common possible slip here is to use the right rule on the wrong structure.\n\nFor this question:\n\nWhat is 64^2 ÷ 8^3?\n\nStart from this clue:\nWrite 64 as 2^6 and 8 as 2^3.\n\nThen follow the second clue and solve only after the expression is rewritten correctly.",
